WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.418 --> 00:00:03.213
限定本轮检查路径 / Scope the inspection path

2
00:00:03.213 --> 00:00:05.968
开启 Recording / Start Recording

3
00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:08.764
发送长正文 POST / Send the long-body POST

4
00:00:08.764 --> 00:00:11.606
暂停后检查已捕获请求 / Pause before inspecting the captured request

5
00:00:11.606 --> 00:00:14.657
选择 body 请求 / Select the body request

6
00:00:14.657 --> 00:00:17.469
查看 Headers / Inspect Headers

7
00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:20.306
折叠 General / Collapse General

8
00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:23.156
重新展开 General / Expand General again

9
00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:26.913
打开 Request 正文 / Open the Request body

10
00:00:26.913 --> 00:00:29.907
选择请求 Raw / Select request Raw

11
00:00:29.907 --> 00:00:39.008
拖动分栏扩大详情 / Drag the splitter to widen details

12
00:00:39.008 --> 00:00:42.007
在正文内使用滚轮 / Scroll inside the body with the wheel

13
00:00:42.007 --> 00:00:44.907
用键盘到达请求末尾 / Reach the request end with the keyboard

14
00:00:44.907 --> 00:00:47.856
在详情边缘向上滚动 / Scroll up at the Inspector edge

15
00:00:47.856 --> 00:00:50.915
正文到底后继续滚动外层 / Continue scrolling the outer pane at the body boundary

16
00:00:50.915 --> 00:00:53.808
复制完整请求正文 / Copy the complete request body

17
00:00:53.808 --> 00:00:56.710
打开 Markdown Preview / Open Markdown Preview

18
00:00:56.710 --> 00:00:59.608
右方向键切换 Split / Use ArrowRight to switch to Split

19
00:00:59.608 --> 00:01:02.463
再次右移切换 Source / Press ArrowRight again for Source

20
00:01:02.463 --> 00:01:05.307
复制 Markdown Source / Copy Markdown Source

21
00:01:05.307 --> 00:01:08.219
滚动长 Source / Scroll the long Source

22
00:01:08.219 --> 00:01:11.057
用键盘查看 Source 末尾 / Use the keyboard to inspect the Source end

23
00:01:11.057 --> 00:01:13.957
全屏查看 Source / View Source fullscreen

24
00:01:13.957 --> 00:01:16.912
Escape 返回 Source / Return to Source with Escape

25
00:01:16.912 --> 00:01:19.756
返回 Markdown Preview / Return to Markdown Preview

26
00:01:19.756 --> 00:01:22.608
查看同一响应的 Hex / Inspect Hex for the same response

27
00:01:22.608 --> 00:01:26.207
拖回原来的详情宽度 / Restore the original detail width

28
00:01:26.207 --> 00:01:29.006
关闭详情回到列表 / Close details and return to the list

29
00:01:29.006 --> 00:01:31.858
Clear 本轮临时记录 / Clear this run’s temporary records

30
00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:34.707
清理后重新开启 Recording / Resume Recording after Clear

31
00:01:34.707 --> 00:01:37.515
发送清理后的新请求 / Send a new request after Clear

32
00:01:37.515 --> 00:01:40.514
确认新请求正文可读 / Verify the new request body is readable
